	(descr "Seeed XIAO ESP32C6, mounted face down into two 1x7 2.54mm sockets. Pads mirrored (y) from Seeed XIAO-ESP32-C6-DIP; rows 15.24 mm apart. USB-C, buttons, U.FL and chip antenna face this board. The USB-C receptacle sticks out 2.0 mm past the XIAO board edge (measured); the silk outline stops at x 9.9 so it stays on the carrier, whose back edge the XIAO overhangs by 0.5 mm.")
